Bundled static data and its provenance
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1) src/data/il-ilce.ts — provinces, plate codes and districts

   The 81 provinces and 973 districts are official administrative divisions of
   Türkiye (T.C. İçişleri Bakanlığı, "Mülki İdare Bölümleri Envanteri"); names
   of administrative units are public facts.

   The district lists were seeded from merkdev/Turkiye-iller-ilceler-PHP-Array
   (https://github.com/merkdev/Turkiye-iller-ilceler-PHP-Array), which is
   distributed under the MIT License:

